Chemical manufacturing methods and their fuller source collection are shared through [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618), including [Industrial Chemical Technology I — Adebayo, NOUN](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Industrial-Chemical-Technology-I-NOUN.lingua#r_2026VMVXVJQGK3WTH1P17FE8T9), [Inorganic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Inorganic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_77Z8T5RFYFNNXZ7XKZFKPRKDKR), [Organic Chemical Technology — Nanda Kishore, NPTEL](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Organic-Chemical-Technology-Kishore.lingua#r_1ERYESBGNKCKMDY0NPHJKCVJG0), [Production of Chlor-alkali, BREF CAK](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Chlor-Alkali-Production-BREF.lingua#r_69QNQ29VT4NA2MXHTVWDNP8T2W), [Large Volume Inorganic Chemicals — Ammonia, Acids and Fertilisers, BREF LVIC-AAF](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Ammonia-Acids-Fertilisers-BREF.lingua#r_45NWBJYAMXXSRV071A57EM02GB), [Production of Large Volume Organic Chemicals, BREF LVOC](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Large-Volume-Organic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_78ET6A4D7AX8HPQTYAMZMAG16B), [Production of Polymers, BREF POL](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Polymer-Production-BREF.lingua#r_01PXATYT6P16206KQ3VDX34K1F), [Production of Speciality Inorganic Chemicals, BREF SIC](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Speciality-Inorganic-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_04G7NFYXE76QCB3DXCRJC1FSCP) and [Manufacture of Organic Fine Chemicals, BREF OFC](../../../stem/chemistry/industrial-chemistry/sources/Organic-Fine-Chemicals-BREF.lingua#r_0DH473049K4WX7HAAY1P7SDS3K). Quantitative, measurement and computational methods remain available through [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5) and [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ). A public catalogue or abstract identifies a work; obtain and read the complete method before making a claim that depends on it.

